  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Atik Alias Akib Alias Don Mohammed ... vs The State Of Maharashtra on 14 August, 2025 1409.25aba (1) In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 906 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1409 Of 2025 Atik Alias Akib Alias Don Mohammed Shaikh Versus The State Of Maharashtra ..... Ms Sunita G. Sonawane, Advocate for Applicant. Mr A. V. Lavte, App for respondent/State. ..... Coram : Advait M. Sethna, J. Date : 14 August 2025",
    "facts": "4. The Application is filed under Section 482 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, as the Applicant apprehends arrest. The proceedings relate to Crime No.0354/2025. 1409.25aba (2) The First Information Report (\"FIR\") has been lodged on 14 July 2025 at 03:40 hours registered by the Akole Police Station, District Atik Alias Akib Alias Don Mohammed ... vs The State Of Maharashtra on 14 August, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/112253718/ 1 Ahilyanagar. The occurrence of the offence is shown on 13 July 2025. The offences alleged are under Sections 26(2)(iv), 27(3)(d), 27(3)(e), 30(2)(a), 3(1)(zz)(iv) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (for short 'the said Act') and under Section 123, 223, 274 and 275 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023. The informant is one Rajesh Namdeo Bade, aged 50 years. 6. It appears that the name of the Applicant is disclosed in the FIR. It further appears that the Applicant is the supplier of the said contraband which is banned substance under the provisions of the said Act. The said contraband was duly seized and no further recoveries are to be effected. Such 1409.25aba (3) protection was on the basis of the order passed by this Court on 22 July 2025 in Anticipatory Bail Application No.857/2025 and connected proceedings concerning contraband i.e. Gutkha. The Applicant has one criminal antecedent. In this regard, learned Advocate for the Applicant has placed before the Court an order dated 18 July 2025, passed by the Sessions Court, Ahmednagar.",
    "arguments": "7. Ms Sonawane, learned Advocate for the Applicant would draw attention of the Court to the order dated 23 July 2025 in Anticipatory Bail Application No.1248/2025, thereby similarly placed Applicant was protected by the order of interim protection.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "7. Ms Sonawane, learned Advocate for the Applicant would draw attention of the Court to the order dated 23 July 2025 in Anticipatory Bail Application No.1248/2025, thereby similarly placed Applicant was protected by the order of interim protection.",
